    {
      "id": "claim_ff265951cc8f4170bec12caab9dc6077",
      "statement": "The three neural model families declare a GPU requirement, and when no accelerator is available and CPU execution has not been permitted they are omitted from the specs and returned in a skipped map with the recorded reason, so a cell evaluated without them says so.",
