    {
      "id": "claim_5ee1f57f6e3a4c5689a37c18770c7f3d",
      "statement": "The same flow automaton is reused during neural training: with a non-zero auxiliary weight the torch base builds a per-step legality mask from it while encoding training data, so decoder and training loop share one definition of a legal transition.",
