    {
      "id": "claim_7d06f0ded0874cc1a39b5c06f7555047",
      "statement": "Pairing is verified rather than assumed: when a cluster's protocol list and per-trace row count disagree the run aborts reporting both counts, guarding against comparing one process's result against another's.",
